.Sh CONFIGURATION
.Nm
reads configuration from
.Pa ~/.dmed.conf
(global) and
.Pa .dmed.conf
in the project root (overrides global).
Settings hot-reload on save.
.Pp
The configuration file uses INI format with the following sections:
.Ss [editor]
.Bl -tag -width "syntax_theme"
.It Sy tab_width Ns = Ns Ar N
Tab display width (default: 4).
.It Sy syntax_theme Ns = Ns Ar name
Chroma syntax theme name (default: monokai).
.It Sy line_numbers Ns = Ns Ar bool
Show line numbers (default: true).
.It Sy word_wrap Ns = Ns Ar bool
Wrap long lines to the pane width (default: false; Alt+Z toggles).
.It Sy skipped_dirs Ns = Ns Ar list
Comma-separated directories to skip in tree/finder
(default: .git,node_modules).
.El
.Ss [ai]
.Bl -tag -width "ollama_url"
.It Sy provider Ns = Ns Ar type
AI backend (default: ollama). Wizard presets: Ollama (local), OpenAI,
DeepSeek, Groq, LM Studio (local), vLLM (local), Custom; the legacy values
ollama / openai still work.
.It Sy model Ns = Ns Ar name
Model tag (e.g. gpt-4, qwen2.5-coder:7b).
.It Sy ollama_url Ns = Ns Ar url
Ollama server URL (default: http://localhost:11434).
.It Sy api_key Ns = Ns Ar key
API key for OpenAI-compatible providers.
.It Sy system_prompt Ns = Ns Ar text
System prompt for AI conversations.
.It Sy context_max Ns = Ns Ar N
Max runes sent as file context (default: 6000).
.It Sy temperature Ns = Ns Ar N
Generation temperature in tenths (7 means 0.7); 0 uses the provider default.
.It Sy num_ctx Ns = Ns Ar N
Context window in tokens for Ollama (num_ctx); 0 uses the default.
.It Sy num_predict Ns = Ns Ar N
Maximum output tokens; 0 uses the provider default.
.It Sy tool_rounds Ns = Ns Ar N
Cap on the chat tool-calling loop depth; 0 uses the built-in cap (6).
.It Sy allow_run Ns = Ns Ar value
Whether the model may run shell commands (RUN tool): always, never or ask
(default: always).
.It Sy restrict_to_root Ns = Ns Ar bool
Bound READ/EDIT/REPLACE paths to the project root (default: false).
.El
.Ss [agent]
.Bl -tag -width "system_prompt"
.It Sy system_prompt Ns = Ns Ar text
Instruction override for background agents producing edits; empty uses the
built-in prompt.
.It Sy context_max Ns = Ns Ar N
Total size budget in bytes of file context gathered for an agent task
(default: 262144).
.El
.Ss [debug]
.Bl -tag -width "adapter_mode"
.It Sy mode Ns = Ns Ar type
Launch mode passed to the adapter (Delve: debug, test or exec; default: debug).
.It Sy program Ns = Ns Ar path
Package directory, executable or module entry; empty derives the active
file's directory.
.It Sy args Ns = Ns Ar string
Whitespace-separated arguments for the debuggee.
.It Sy stop_on_entry Ns = Ns Ar bool
Pause at program start (default: false).
.It Sy adapter_cmd Ns = Ns Ar path
DAP adapter binary (default: dlv); the legacy dlv_path key is an alias.
.It Sy adapter_mode Ns = Ns Ar mode
reverse (the adapter dials us back) or stdio (stdin/stdout DAP);
default: reverse.
.It Sy adapter_args Ns = Ns Ar string
Extra CLI arguments for the adapter process.
.It Sy launch_type Ns = Ns Ar name
DAP launch "type" field (default: go).
.It Sy launch_request Ns = Ns Ar kind
launch or attach (default: launch).
.It Sy launch_json Ns = Ns Ar json
Raw JSON merged into the launch body; adapter-specific keys override the
built-in ones.
.El
.Ss [ui]
.Bl -tag -width "chat_width_pct"
.It Sy tree_width Ns = Ns Ar N
Project tree sidebar width in columns (default: 25).
.It Sy chat_width_pct Ns = Ns Ar N
Chat panel width as percentage of screen (default: 40).
.It Sy lang Ns = Ns Ar code
UI language: en or ru (default: en).
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "~/.dmed.conf"
.It Pa ~/.dmed.conf
Global configuration file.
.It Pa ./.dmed.conf
Project-level configuration (overrides global).
.It Pa ./.dmed-session.json
Session state (open tabs, cursor positions).
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width "DMED_DEBUG_KEYS"
.It Ev DMED_PROVIDER
Override the AI provider.
.It Ev DMED_MODEL
Override the default AI model.
.It Ev DMED_OLLAMA_URL
Override the Ollama server URL.
.It Ev DMED_API_KEY
Override the API key for OpenAI-compatible providers.
.It Ev DMED_LANG
UI language: en or ru.
.It Ev DMED_SHELL
Shell used by the terminal panel.
.It Ev DMED_PLUGIN_REPO
Override the plugin store repository (owner/repo).
.It Ev DMED_TEMPERATURE
Override the generation temperature (in tenths).
.It Ev DMED_NUM_CTX
Override the Ollama context window (num_ctx).
.It Ev DMED_NUM_PREDICT
Override the maximum output tokens.
.It Ev DMED_TOOL_ROUNDS
Override the chat tool-calling loop cap.
.It Ev DMED_ALLOW_RUN
Override RUN-tool policy: always, never or ask.
.It Ev DMED_DEBUG_KEYS
When set, recognized keys are echoed into the status bar (debugging aid).
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh EXAMPLES
Open a file:
.Pp
.Dl $ dmed main.go
.Pp
Open a project directory:
.Pp
.Dl $ dmed .
.Pp
Open multiple files:
.Pp
.Dl $ dmed src/*.go
.Pp
Configure AI interactively:
.Pp
.Dl $ dmed setup-ai
.Pp
With AI configured for OpenAI:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
[ai]
provider = openai
model = gpt-4
api_key = sk-...
.Ed
